{"id":"14edfe8464cb3fae","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-isomorphism.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive4 Borel Isomorphism","display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-isomorphism — ZFC Descriptive4 Borel Isomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-isomorphism","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-isomorphism"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-isomorphism — ZFC Descriptive4 Borel Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-isomorphism — ZFC Descriptive4 Borel Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> (underlying sets)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\">\\(\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\)</span> (sigma-algebras)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Y^X\">\\(f\\in Y^X\\)</span> (candidate map)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (bijection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BorelIsomorphism}\">\\(\\operatorname{BorelIsomorphism}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\">\\(f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\\)</span>；函数图及定义域使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\operatorname{BorelIsomorphism}(f,X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal T,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\\land \\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma)\\land \\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;(f[A]\\in\\mathcal T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\operatorname{BorelIsomorphism}(f,X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal T,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\\land \\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma)\\land \\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;(f[A]\\in\\mathcal T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both the map and its inverse are measurable with respect to the declared sigma-algebras.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}$ (bijection predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[58-df-sigma-algebra]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对函数图 $f$ 与集合 $B$，$f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}$；函数图及定义域使用 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BorelIsomorphism}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\operatorname{BorelIsomorphism}(f,X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal T,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,X,Y)\\land \\forall B\\in\\mathcal T\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma)\\land \\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;(f[A]\\in\\mathcal T)","display":true}],"bytes":1493,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1838","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-isomorphism.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-isomorphism]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d583890235faf0d5","a740bdad87b97ac6","36d7463d215be751"]}